  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;dinsatser Turkiet 2019- 2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support measures Turkey 2019- 2020 - Freedom of Expression (FoE ) Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att finansiera sm&#xe5; och korta initiativ som &#xe4;r strategiska f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av resultatstrategin f&#xf6;r Sveriges reformsamarbete med &#xd6;steuropa, v&#xe4;stra Balkan och Turkiet 2014-2020, men det faller utanf&#xf6;r ramen f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;rre bidrag i respektive resultatomr&#xe5;den. Initiativ som kan finansieras &#xe4;r f&#xf6;rberedande studier, upphandlade utv&#xe4;rderingar, partners studiebes&#xf6;k samt partnerkonferens, seminarium, HR eller fri mediadag, festival eller liknande. Revisionstj&#xe4;nster kan ocks&#xe5; finansieras n&#xe4;r det inte finansieras inom ramen f&#xf6;r partneravtalet. Exempel p&#xe5; detta &#xe4;r en systemrevision eller en s&#xe4;rskild granskning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Strategic Fund is to finance small and short initiatives which are strategic to the implementation of the Results strategy for Sweden&#xb4;s reform cooperation with Eastern Europe, the Western Balkans and Turkey 2014-2020, but that fall outside the framework of the larger contributions in the respective result areas.Initiatives that can be financed are preparatory studies prior to possible assessments, procured reviews and evaluations, partner&#x2019;s study visits and publications, as well as a partner&#x2019;s conference, seminar, HR or free media day, festival or similar. Audit services may also be financed under this contribution when not financed within the partner agreement. Examples of this is a system audit, forensic audit or a special review.</narrative>
  </description>
